hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18483","Mutamir narrated to us, he said: I heard Ayyub, he said: And Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Tufawi narrated to us, he said: Ayyub narrated to us likewise, from Humayd ibn Hilal, from Abi Burdah, from a man of the Emigrants who says: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: O people, repent to Allah and seek His forgiveness, for I repent to Allah and seek His forgiveness every day a hundred times, or more than a hundred times."
